c MaxSAT instance in the MSE-2022 (new) WCNF format.
c Hard clause 1:  h 1 0     ->  (x1)
c Hard clause 2:  h -01 0   ->  (~x1)      because DIMACS literal -01 == -1
c Soft clause  :  5 2 0     ->  (x2) with weight 5
c The two hard clauses are contradictory, so the instance is INFEASIBLE.
h 1 0
h -01 0
5 2 0
